WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Assess prerequisites
for the selected workflow.

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:07.040
Infrastructure and pipelines,
resettable data, controlled dependencies

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:11.320
and observable applications
determine what can run reliably.

00:00:11.387 --> 00:00:15.920
Approved model access, retained evidence
and operating ownership determine what

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:20.240
can be supported. Add domain
review and a measured baseline.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:24.400
Unknown requirements remain open.
The adoption decision follows accepted

00:00:24.462 --> 00:00:28.640
evidence and funded owners rather
than a generic maturity label.
